### API 1: Send Message
POST http://localhost:3000/send-message
Content-Type: application/json
User-Agent: SMS Forwarder App

{
  "sender": "Ashwin",
  "text": "Hello Ashwin 3 !",
  "sim": "Airtel"
}

### Recent message of each user
GET http://localhost:3000/messages/recent

### Filter by sender
GET http://localhost:3000/messages?sender=Ashwin

### Filter by SIM
GET http://localhost:3000/messages?sim=Jio

### Combined filters
GET http://localhost:3000/messages?from=Ashwin&sim=Jio




